      "name": "Jay Morris",
      "created_at": "2025-08-25T16:18:09.336Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Is it possible to create a Item Group and determine what attributes the Items within that group may have available to them?<br>\nFor example I sell Widgets and place them in a widget group.<br>\nWidgets can be Red, Green, Black or Blue.<br>\nEach widget is its own item and may be form different manufacturers.<br>\nFor consistency, I want to only have the selection of color at the item level based on the Groups attribute values available that color available.<br>\nIf it is possible, how does one set that up?<br>\nAny help is appreciated, thank you!</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/439d5e/{size}.png",
