      "created_at": "2025-08-25T17:45:49.259Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/jaymo\">@JayMo</a></p>\n<p>The Template and Variant setup can be helpful in your case. Please go through following documentation;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/item-variants\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/item-variants</a></p>\n<p>Widget groups can be defined as attributes while creating items in item master.</p>\n<p>I have achieved item group and item templates as button under item table in Selling Cycle doctypes to pull them based on their attributes as well.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/8/28354cda91e0c5dbdb305b72488fc58820169ecd.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/28354cda91e0c5dbdb305b72488fc58820169ecd\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/8/28354cda91e0c5dbdb305b72488fc58820169ecd_2_690x358.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"5JHie6oD7iSe2nP32B3WsffLcBf\" width=\"690\" height=\"358\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/8/28354cda91e0c5dbdb305b72488fc58820169ecd_2_690x358.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/8/28354cda91e0c5dbdb305b72488fc58820169ecd_2_1035x537.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/8/28354cda91e0c5dbdb305b72488fc58820169ecd_2_1380x716.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBF9F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1757×912 72 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>By pressing on item template button, the pop up will list out all child items with its attributes values where you can pick &amp; choose item to be listed in your Quotation doctype item table.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/c/2cf0e81f7b8fd5b8ec094feea499cd3909d81d57.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/2cf0e81f7b8fd5b8ec094feea499cd3909d81d57\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/c/2cf0e81f7b8fd5b8ec094feea499cd3909d81d57_2_690x417.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"6pz9eIits2vBD7KyaTKD3o1ceSr\" width=\"690\" height=\"417\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/c/2cf0e81f7b8fd5b8ec094feea499cd3909d81d57_2_690x417.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/c/2cf0e81f7b8fd5b8ec094feea499cd3909d81d57_2_1035x625.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/c/2cf0e81f7b8fd5b8ec094feea499cd3909d81d57_2_1380x834.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"C6C4BE\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1398×845 71.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>The same parent can be achieved in item master by writing some code for which we can help you.</p>",
